.TH DANNAN-VERSION 1 2026-11-13 Dannan "Dannan tools"
.SH NAME
dannan-version \- print the installed Dannan library's version
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dannan-version
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dannan-version
prints the version of the Dannan library it loaded, as
.BI "dannan " x.y.z\fR.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 2 for a usage error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dannan-ca (1),
.BR dannan-import-macha (1)
